\p{One arena-shaped container per configuration (8 performance cores, 16 GB, no network), tests one after the other, the arena's time limit per test, \code{\verb~|perf stat~} + GNU time around the run line (\code{\verb~|bench/run-suite.py --perf --arena-timeouts~}).}

