\title{0.4 What it would take, in instructions (aarch64 counts of this host, whole process, 4 workers)}

\p{Places are projected with nano-lean's ratio (0.915); "range" = the 0.90 .. 1.05 extremes. Thresholds in this host's counts: place 7 below 2,592 G (2,550 .. 2,975), place 6 below 2,358 G (2,320 .. 2,706), place 5 below pestka's 1,339.6 G measured here, place 4 below rpylean's 544.4 G, place 3 below 505.6 G, place 2 below 419.1 G, place 1 below 361.2 G.}

